1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,260
Fall in Love with English.
爱上英语。

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:50,653
Hiding behind the loose dusty curtain, a teenager packed up his overcoat into the suitcase. He planned to leave home at dusk though there was thunder and lightning outdoors. He had got to do this because he was tired of his parents’ nagging about his English study and did not want to go through it any longer.
躲在松垮、落满灰尘的窗帘后面，一个少年把大衣装进了行李箱。他打算在黄昏时离家，尽管外面雷鸣电闪。他觉得自己不得不这么做，因为他厌倦了父母对自己英语学习的唠叨，不想再忍受下去。

3
00:00:50,653 --> 00:01:30,313
He couldn’t get along well with English and disliked joining in English classes because he thought his teacher ignored him on purpose. As a result, his score in each exam never added up to over 60. His partner was concerned about him very much.
他的英语总是学不好，也不喜欢参加英语课，因为他觉得老师在故意忽视他。结果，他每次考试的分数都没有超过60分。他的伙伴非常关心他。

4
00:01:30,313 --> 00:02:17,440
She understood exactly what he was suffering from, but entirely disagreed with his idea. In order to calm him down and settle his problem, she talked with him face to face and swapped a series of learning tips with him. The items she set down helped him find the highway to studying English well.
她完全理解他的苦恼，但十分反对他的想法。为了让他冷静下来、解决问题，她与他面对面地交谈，分享了一系列学习技巧。她记下的这些要点帮助他找到了捷径，通向学好英语的道路。

5
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:40,833
The teenager was grateful and got great power from his friend’s words. Now, he has recovered from being upset and has fallen in love with English.
少年很感激，从朋友的话中获得了巨大力量。如今，他摆脱了沮丧，已经爱上了英语。
